WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500
As Markiplier enters, he begins his journey through his many thoughts of Jack.

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.360
Mark sits down getting ready for his journey. He was going to confess love to Jack today.

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:03.860
But first, breakfast. Ah yes, the best meal of the day. Breakfast

00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:07.060
As he sips from the mug of goodness, he looks at the cereal box and imagines Cornflakes X Markiplier fanfics.

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:10.580
Markiplier clears those thoughts from his mind and sets his cup down.

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:14.700
As Markiplier grabs the box of Corn Flakes, he wonders again about the possiblily of a Cornflakes X Markiplier fanic.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.620
Markiplier smiles as his children pour out of the cornflake box.

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:22.060
"Come on my children, i just want to eat you!" Markiplier thinks, coaxing the cereal out of the box with an encouraging look on his face.

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:24.080
The wild Markimoo is content.

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.140
Markiplier opens the milk and imagines pouring it on Jack.

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:28.280
He continues twisting, imagining that same thought.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:31.020
It opens and in Markimoo's dreaming state of mind, he accidentally spills some milk on the counter.

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:32.420
*Splish, sploosh*

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:35.020
Markiplier has not noticed the rogue milk.

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:37.320
The red haired cutie (In Jack's opinion) continues to poor milk until he is satisfied.

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:39.340
Markimoo is pleased.

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:41.640
"Thank you, dear friend." He says in his mind.

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:43.280
He puts the cap back on the milk. This is a perfect time for the narrator to add in some self advertising, so, I am Amytoadstool, you may find me in the comments. &lt;3

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:44.760
Markiplier notices the stray milk. In his mind, he just burnt the world to a crisp and ate it with a smile on his face.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:45.260
He carefully swipes away the milk...

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:45.980
...But gets bored and stops.

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:47.960
"Step away, biatch." Markiplier thinks, smiling in glee as he pushes his rival away from his presence.

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:50.160
He then draws his true love (Well, his OTHER true love) closer.

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:52.080
He grabs the mystical spoon.

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:54.200
*Slish!* Goes the spoon, delving into the depths of the milky ocean to search for hidden treasures.

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.880
Spoon brings his treasures to Markimoo The Master's mouth for inspection.

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:58.140
"Hmm, by complete scientific, i can decree that that is a cornflake!" Markimoo thinks, proud at his ability to know off by heart this treasure.

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.200
"How would this taste on Ja- Woah! Don't wanna go there yet, save that for tonight! " He thinks.

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:01.600
"Oh look, another Septiplier shipper!"

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:03.080
"So... Many.... Shippers..." He thinks with his majestic yet tiny brain.

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:05.220
"What a magnificent ship." He turns his head to the side, daydreaming about eyes and greenness.

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:07.700
Markiplier raises his eyebrow, thinking thoughts that the fans will never know.

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.120
"That's a good idea!" He smiles, nodding in acceptance at his past thoughts.

00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:11.600
Spoon brings in another bounty of treasures.

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:12.940
"More cornflakes... I'm getting good at this!" :3

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:14.420
He shakes his head in pleasure.

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:15.640
*The wild Markimoo is content in his thoughts of a small leprechaun.*

00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:18.080
"Leprechauns are sexy." Markiplier concludes.

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:19.140
"Aaah."

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:20.580
"Darkiplier shut up."

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:23.920
In deep thought...

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:25.160
"Yes, I'm sure he'd enjoy that."

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:26.460
Spoon brings in more treasure.

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:28.640
Nom, nom nom, and the treasure is gone!

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:30.540
In deep thought, yet again.

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:32.320
"Oh heeeelll nah! Fangirls, get out mah house!"

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:33.880
"Oh, its cupid."

00:01:33.880 --> 00:01:37.000
"You do your job well." He thinks.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:37.780
Looking for more cupids.

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:39.320
"Oh, your siblings....? Mother?" The markiplier is confuzzled, but smiles anyway.

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:40.820
"What a nice bow."

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:42.280
"Man, I sure am glad those dudes hit me and him."

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:48.260
Examines more of the treasure.

00:01:48.260 --> 00:01:50.360
"I be bored now. JACK! ENTERTAIN ME!" He settles to drumming the table instead, knowing his senpai would not come to entertain him.

00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:51.680
"Eh, he's irish!"  (No offence to irish pplz, luv u guys! With your adorable little accents, i just wanna keep you as pets! Oh... Sorry. :3)

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:52.900
"So, my nemesis, we meet again."

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:57.020
Markimoo picks up his nemesis and blows it, gently washing away the evil.

00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:59.180
*Sounds of a quiet whirlpool can be heard.*

00:01:59.440 --> 00:02:00.180
 

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:01.320
"Aaah."

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:03.300
Clonk.

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:04.400
He grabs Spoon and sends him on another adventure.

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:05.220
Spoon shoves the treasure in Markimoo's mouth.

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:06.420
Yum.

00:02:06.420 --> 00:02:08.240
"Oh look, more Septiplier fan art!"

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:12.000
It's pretty good stuff.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:13.540
"Oh if only they knew..."

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:15.240
"...Septiplier shippers across the globe would die because their life goal was complete."

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:17.820
Markiplier watches more and more Septiplier fan art appear on his ceiling.

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:19.340
"Come on guys, at least make me look better than a dying goat!"

00:02:19.340 --> 00:02:20.520
"Ah, oh well."

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:23.500
More treasure.

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:29.060
Markiplier cruelly shoves Spoon under and above water, taunting him.

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:31.620
Markimoo inspects the treasure.

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:32.800
"Cornflakes!" Markimoo is proud.

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:34.120
"Hmm, more treasure!"

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:36.680
"Still cornflakes..."

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:37.520
*Strange sex noise.* (o.O)

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:39.740
Markimoo goes mad for a while and torments poor Spoonie.

00:02:39.740 --> 00:02:41.400
More treasure.... (The Amytoadstool is bored. XD)

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:43.740
Content.

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:47.920
"Sorry if this is getting boring... I'm trying to entertain you! ARE YOU NOT ENTERTAINED?!" Yells the wild Amytoadstool.

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:50.600
"Ewwie! It tastes like sex..."

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:52.320
"Oh wait that's my tongue! Hehehe."

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:54.460
More tapping insues as he watches millions of Septiplier shippers scream as he says hi to Jack. (Me included. :3)

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:56.340
"Oooooh... That was an interesting fanfic..."

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:57.780
He is happy, as he managed to escape the wrath of the fanfic.

00:02:57.780 --> 00:02:59.540
"Ahhh..... It's actually not that bad!" He smiles, continuing to read the fanfic.

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:00.900
"Oh look! A random inanimate object!"

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:03.260
"What a interesting object."

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:04.800
"Hmm? Oh, just fangirls swarming at my window."

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:06.540
"Hi there."

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:08.040
"Those guys are silly." He looks back at the inanimate object.

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:08.580
*wipe*

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:09.680
Good object.

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:11.140
Very good object.

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:13.620
"How'd cornflakes get my nudes?! Must admit though, i'm pretty hot."

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:15.280
Chewing ensues

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:16.460
Spoon delves in.

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:17.880
Markiplier inspects the treasure Spoon brought back... Again... For like the twelfth time...

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:19.240
 

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:21.220
"Back up biatch."

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:23.720
"Aaah, my friend."

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:26.400
Markiplier sips of the liquid bossness.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:27.360
"Perfect... Jack must have made it."

00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:31.240
Markiplier sips more of Le Liquid Bossness.

00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:34.360
"Ahhh..." Markiplier resists the sudden urge to shout, "SPEEED ISSS KEEEEEEY!!!!"

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:35.560
He puts the glass back down.

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:37.280
Loud "Aaah!"

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:38.340
"Treasure? Mr. Spoon?" ("Oh dear god, please no...." Amytoadstool begs.)

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:40.620
"Wait a minute, come here you sly devil you." ("Yay!! Thank you mug!! &lt;3)

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:42.460
Markiplier picks up the cup and sniffs it lightly.

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:45.640
*sip*

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:46.220
 

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:47.000
"Aaah"

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:48.260
*clonk*

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:49.960
*stir stir stir*

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:51.380
Markiplier inspects the- "DEAR GOD NO! NO, NO, NO, NO NO! NO, NO, NO, NO NO! NO, NO, NO, NO NO! NO, NO, NO, NO NO! NO, NO, NO, NO!" Narrator shouts.

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:52.900
 

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:54.640
Markiplier internally wades through more Septiplier fanfics and fan art.

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:55.820
He laughs because he is enjoying it.

00:03:56.140 --> 00:03:58.340
*still laughing, now tapping however.*

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.740
Markiplier- "No! Don't you dare!" Markiplier ate cereal.

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:01.340
*mouth opens*

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:01.860
*nom.*

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:03.880
Ma- *Narrator glares* Cornflakes die.

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:05.260
He taps for a while.

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:09.400
He thinks of jack again, and then the arrangement tonight.

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:11.500
 

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:14.020
"Wait... I did remember to tell Jack to bring a spare pair of boxers, right?"

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:15.340
"Oh well! I'm sure he could guess from the text!"

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:17.580
Markiplier ferociously eats his cereal.

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:18.480
*crunch*

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:22.960
Markiplier annoys the crap out of everyone watching.

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:23.840
*shake shake shake*

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:25.320
*Crunch, crunch, crunch*

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:26.480
*sips up sweet liquid.*

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:29.220
Markiplier is happy.

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:31.080
"Oh no! He's choking!"

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:32.260
Mark hits the counter. Narrator calls Counter Abuse.

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:33.340
*thump*

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:34.980
Markiplier is no longer choking.

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:36.840
*Shakes shoulder.*

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:39.980
Nothing for quite some time.

00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:41.400
Markimoo smiles.

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:43.340
Markiplier looks up, smiling at the hundreds of pictures of Jack painted in his mind.

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.640
"Oh well, I'm sure he loved me then too."

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:46.800
Markimoo sips his nemesis as Doggie barks in the background.

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:48.040
Markiplier turns

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:48.540
"SHUT UP PUPPEH!"

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:49.520
"Nooo, you're to cute to shut up! You're my little Jackiebo- I MEAN MARSHMALLOW... Totally..."

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:50.020
Bats at invisible fly

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:52.860
Markiplier begins to sip the coffee.

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:56.180
Markiplier pauses as he sifts through memories.

00:04:56.180 --> 00:05:00.480
(Amytoadstool is sorry if you are unamused by these subtitles. She hopes you have a good day/night/one-night stand, I MEAN! Umm... One-night handstand..? Yah...)

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:01.860
Markiplier sees his favorite person. Or rather favorite pupper. (Thats so cute i have to leave it in)

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:03.820
With a smile, Markiplier puts his cup down.

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:06.360
*CLUNK* Markimoo gets up.

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:07.080
Mark leaves, his trolling complete. April Fools everbody~

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:07.720
*Awkward Silence fills the room*

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:09.780
Amytoadstool sighs in relief as she no longer has to worry about entertaining pplz.

